{
  "summary": "This experiment tested a multimodal model using scvi_n200 RNA encoder, ViT-L image encoder, transformer aggregation, and weighted fusion, building on prior configurations that showed performance improvements with advanced RNA encoders and weighted fusion. Validation accuracy of 0.7250 and F1 of 0.6847 indicate significant performance gains compared to earlier baselines, suggesting the combination of advanced image encoders and transformer aggregation may be beneficial. However, the relative contribution of ViT-L versus transformer aggregation remains uncertain without direct comparison to alternative encoders or aggregation methods."
}

